    "narrative": "With only four active starters in today\u2019s light slate, the Austin Waves offense relies heavily on **Sam Antonacci**, who claims our highest efficiency score of 63.61. Leading off against Rocker, **Sam Antonacci** benefits from an elite lineup position and a platoon advantage that pushes his value well above his base projection. While **Nasim Nunez** (59.76) and **Miguel Vargas** (55.00) also feature in the starting quartet, **Nasim Nunez** serves as our primary engine for stolen bases against Feltner\u2019s weak 5.10 xERA. Despite hitting in the 9-hole, the matchup profile for **Nasim Nunez** provides high-upside potential for a multi-steal game, which remains our highest priority in the current Roto standings.\n\nRounding out the lineup, **Miguel Vargas** and **Jackson Merrill** (51.66) offer solid, if unspectacular, floors. **Jackson Merrill** faces the toughest task today against Ashcraft, whose 3.28 xERA suppresses the overall scoring output. We are effectively punting the bench slots, as the remainder of our core\u2014including **Kyle Tucker**, **Gunnar Henderson**, **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.**, and **Luis Robert Jr.**\u2014are sidelined by a team-wide off-day. With no viable alternatives like **Andy Pages**, **Jordan Westburg**, or **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** available to swap in, our limited roster must lean on the speed of **Nasim Nunez** and the plate discipline of **Sam Antonacci** to generate enough volume in R and SB to maintain our competitive edge. There are no immediate weather threats, but the lack of depth on the bench places an unusually high burden on these four starters to avoid early substitutions or defensive replacements that could hamper our quest for category efficiency.",
